BoneWings: Halves flight time when taking a hit
DemonWings: Increases fall speed
FestiveWings: Homing ornaments rain down as you fly
FinWings: Allows quick travel in water
TatteredFairyWings: You leave a trail of fairy dust as you fly
WingsNebula: Increases the pickup range of Nebula armor's nebula boosters
WingsSolar: Allows Solar Flare armor's dash to be used without any charges
WingsStardust: Greatly increases Stardust armor's stardust guardian damage and attack range
WingsVortex: Vortex armor's stealth ability is automatically reactivated 1 second after dashing
